      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I’m working on customizing the<br>\n<strong>Event creation</strong> flow inside the <strong>Opportunity</strong> doctype. Under the <strong>Activities</strong> tab, when I click “New Event”, I want the <strong>“Public” checkbox to be automatically checked</strong>.</p>\n<p>My use case:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Event is being created from inside the Opportunity screen (reference_type = “Opportunity”)</li>\n<li>I want the “Public” checkbox to be checks Always</li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/0/c039e3a84ceb45d055005e99da5a8957cbfb032b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c039e3a84ceb45d055005e99da5a8957cbfb032b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/0/c039e3a84ceb45d055005e99da5a8957cbfb032b_2_690x143.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"rqvHuLijf7tVruUeLZ7IKT3Y7O3\" width=\"690\" height=\"143\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/0/c039e3a84ceb45d055005e99da5a8957cbfb032b_2_690x143.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/0/c039e3a84ceb45d055005e99da5a8957cbfb032b_2_1035x214.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/0/c039e3a84ceb45d055005e99da5a8957cbfb032b_2_1380x286.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1730×361 32.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5e0e2c223a376e0c745b6eb23ffa2b9a1446e4b2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5e0e2c223a376e0c745b6eb23ffa2b9a1446e4b2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5e0e2c223a376e0c745b6eb23ffa2b9a1446e4b2_2_328x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dq3fhkljGiArOKnawivK14OFMdQ\" width=\"328\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5e0e2c223a376e0c745b6eb23ffa2b9a1446e4b2_2_328x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5e0e2c223a376e0c745b6eb23ffa2b9a1446e4b2_2_492x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5e0e2c223a376e0c745b6eb23ffa2b9a1446e4b2.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">577×877 16.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Is there a clean way to achieve this using <strong>Client Script</strong>?</p>\n<p>I’ve tried the following script on the <strong>Event doctype</strong>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.ui.form.on('Event', {\n    onload: function(frm) {\n        if (frm.is_new() &amp;&amp; frm.doc.reference_type === 'Opportunity') {\n            frm.set_value('public', 1);\n        }\n    }\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p>Is this the correct approach? Or is there a better hook I should use?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!</p>",
